# Scratch for tools told to keep TMPDIR inside the tree (`export TMPDIR=$PWD/.tmpwork`) when the
# machine's /tmp is full or shared. Untracked-and-not-ignored is enough for `cargo xtask assets` to
# scan it and demand attribution sidecars for a session's own WAV files, which is not a useful gate.
.tmpwork/
